  "question": {
    "text": "The efficiency of a Carnot engine operating with a hot reservoir kept at a temperature of 1000 K is 0.4. It extracts 150 J of heat per cycle from the hot reservoir. The work extracted from this engine is being fully used to run a heat pump which has a coefficient of performance 10 . The hot reservoir of the heat pump is at a temperature of 300 K . Which of the following statements is/are correct:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "wDhfX",
      "text": "Work extracted from the Carnot engine in one cycle is 60 J .",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "UJ1af",
      "text": "Temperature of the cold reservoir of the Carnot engine is 600 K .",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Wk3zl",
      "text": "Temperature of the cold reservoir of the heat pump is 270 K .",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "P7Hxw",
      "text": "Heat supplied to the hot reservoir of the heat pump in one cycle is 540 J .",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/Acv2wbM735ahbuwa8KLK0Zb5WZzoSB5C_5aRXOhpspg.original.fullsize.png\"><br>$\\begin{aligned} & \\eta=0.4 \\\\ & (\\mathrm{COP})_{\\mathrm{HP}}=10 \\\\ & \\mathrm{~W}=\\eta \\times \\mathrm{Q}_1=0.4 \\times 150=60 \\mathrm{~J} \\\\ & \\mathrm{COP}=\\frac{\\text { Dissered Effect }}{\\text { Work input }} \\\\ & 10=\\frac{\\mathrm{Q}_3}{\\mathrm{~W}} \\\\ & \\mathrm{Q}_3=600 \\mathrm{~J} \\\\ & \\text { Also } \\\\ & \\eta=0.4=1-\\frac{\\mathrm{T}_2}{\\mathrm{~T}_1} \\\\ & \\mathrm{~T}_2=600 \\mathrm{~K} \\\\ & \\mathrm{COP}=\\frac{\\mathrm{T}_3}{\\mathrm{~T}_3-\\mathrm{T}_4}=10\\end{aligned}$\n$\\begin{aligned} & =\\frac{300}{300-\\mathrm{T}_4}=10 \\\\ & \\mathrm{~T}_4=270 \\mathrm{~K}\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
